data:bom a iof:DesignSpecification ;
    rdfs:label "Fairphone 4 enriched public-document BOM reconstruction" ;
    dcterms:hasVersion "public-enriched-0.2" ;
    rdfs:comment "Bounded Fairphone 4 public-document reconstruction, enriched from two retained Fairphone documents. Structure: the 13 items of the earlier public reconstruction plus 3 key components from the 2022 repairer key-component table. Suppliers: 75 organisations; 7 item-level associations (final assembly and six key components) and 74 category-level associations across 12 supplier categories from the November 2021 supplier list, with 74 reported sites. Not a complete or certified production BOM; exact revision, quantities and buyers are not established. Supplier links are historical (2021-2022), not current contracts, exclusive sources or buyer relationships. Organisations are not merged across documents except where stated in a link's note. Smelters and refiners (Annex 2) are not included. Item-to-category classifications: 11, all researcher-derived (3 carried from the earlier public reconstruction and 8 added in v0.2 after review); a classification says the item is the kind of component a supplier group produced, not that any listed supplier made it. Every statement carries a status in the assertion audit." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo data:researcher ;
    iof:prescribes data:product .

